about:
  heading: "The Lacamas Lake Estate Sale"
  paragraphs:
    - "Venture across the Columbia River and discover the lavish neighborhood of the LaCamas Lake Estate Sale. This massive home belonged to an award winning designer and is full of exceptional entertaining pieces, stylish vintage clothing, fine art, home decor and wall accents. Being an acclaimed design expert, there is lots of tasteful furniture, sofas, chairs, tables from antiques to mid-century and modern pieces. The owner was passionate host and entertainer with plenty of china, silver servers, and glassware, plus a lot of ceramic accents, accessories, and sculptures for every season. The house spans generations of life, featuring many unique pieces, plenty of the usual sought after estate sale treasures, and some tech updates and electronics in great condition. There is also a couple electric Hoveround wheelchairs, walkers, and other medical equipment including a staircase chairlift system. Every room of this large estate is bursting with furniture and must-have items, including the back patio is loaded with outdoor furniture and exterior decorations. Even the garage is chock-full of great finds from tools/supplies, bolts of fabric, and Christmas decor."
